Hello David,

Julie Laube and Kodi Gilchrist are residents at 4-585 Corydon ave. I have
included them in this email.

They have been residents here since February 1st of 2022 and they were not
provided with the storage unit despite a unit existing that was clearly
marked #4 correlated with their suite. Storage was not included in their
lease agreement but the Landlord has attempted to persuade me that the unit
I have has been provided as a 'courtesy' to me which has been subsequently
recognized as a service provided as they have since given me notice that
they are withdrawing the service of storage unit and I will be receiving a
rent decrease based on this, This should be extended to Julie Laube and
Kodi Gilchrist as they were denied the service on the basis of avoiding
following RTB protocol that would have resulted in necessitating rent
decrease. The amount owing to them should reflect month by month cost since
Feb 2021 or 24 months of service denied.

Please note that my charge is that Thorwin Properties has practiced
deception and fraud in denying Julie Laube and Kodi Gilchrist access to the
storage locker in order to deceitfully avoid following RTB procedure which
should result in rent decrease.

The landlord has engaged in lies and exploitation of both tenant and RTB
and this must be addressed as soon as possible.

Julie Laube +1 (204) 894-3558=E2=80=AC

All the best,
Evan Rosner


